<BaseLayout title="Terms — Yeast Travel" description="Terms for using Yeast Travel research-preview itineraries.">
  <article class="legal shell"><span class="eyebrow">Research preview · 19 July 2026</span><h1>Use the plan.<br/>Check the day.</h1><section><h2>Information product</h2><p>Yeast provides self-guided itinerary information. In this preview it does not sell transport, admission, accommodation or guided-tour services and does not make bookings on your behalf.</p></section><section><h2>Conditions change</h2><p>Opening hours, reservations, fares, weather controls and public access can change after our last check. Always consult the linked official source before departure and follow on-site safety instructions.</p></section><section><h2>External services</h2><p>Maps, ticket platforms and future partner experiences are operated by third parties under their own terms. A link is not a guarantee of availability.</p></section><section><h2>Safety</h2><p>Do not follow an itinerary during severe weather, official closures or when local conditions feel unsafe. Yeast never requires entry to private property, a purchase or interaction with a stranger.</p></section><section><h2>Production requirement</h2><p>These interim terms require review by qualified counsel, along with the operator identity and governing law, before a public commercial launch.</p></section></article>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.legal{max-width:820px;padding-block:70px}.legal h1{margin:25px 0 65px;font-family:var(--display);font-size:clamp(58px,9vw,105px);font-weight:400;line-height:.88;letter-spacing:-.06em}.legal section{padding:25px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.legal h2{font-family:var(--display);font-size:31px;font-weight:400}.legal p{color:var(--muted)}</style>
